Description: A fitted FINN forest model calibrated to the German National Forest
    Inventory (Bundeswaldinventur, BWI; 2002, 2012 and 2022 surveys), packaged as a
    versioned simulation tool. Loads the released parameters, rebuilds the model
    with the installed FINN and simulates annual forest dynamics of 15 tree species
    for new sites, with the management intensity (regular-harvest tier) and a
    soil-moisture drought index as user-settable covariates. The code is
    GPL (>= 3). BWI base data: Thuenen-Institut, licensed CC BY-SA 4.0 (cite
    "Thuenen-Institut, Dritte Bundeswaldinventur - Basisdaten (Stand 20.03.2015)"
    and the BWI 2022 inventory archive, see the README); the fitted parameters
    (release asset) and the BWI-derived example stands in inst/extdata are
    released share-alike under CC BY-SA 4.0 with that attribution
    (inst/model/LICENSE-parameters.md).
